  "description": "Why I’m not panicking over today’s red and what I’m waiting to see before buying again.",
  "body_html": "<p>When the stock market is ACTUALLY at the beginning stages of a bear market, there will be an absolute sea of red. I saw it personally in 2008. We saw it together in 2020 and 2022. Today is a mixed, choppy day, and nothing to panic about. </p><p>Before the crash, I expect there will be mass euphoria, delusional price targets and degenerates sitting in large unrealized profits. But that is not today either…we have fear and worry. Stocks love to climb a wall of worry… so I am optimistic that we will reverse in the near future. The draw downs seem to be getting smaller, as discussed in the video. </p><p>On choppy days like today, I do not do too much. </p><p>I still have <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/the-market-is-panicking-again-heres?r=4z8lgl\">3 stocks I am looking to buy</a>. </strong>I simply want to see the local price action to reverse from the small down trend. I never buy on red days, as odds are that you did NOT time the bottom, and will at least, experience some short term pain. I prefer to buy on green days, because it is more likely our positions will get into profit immediately. </p><p>If you didn’t see yesterday’s episode of Midweek Movers, we had more “Recession Resistant” stocks take the top spots. Those have been performing particularly well through 2026. <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/the-average-midweek-mover-stock-is?r=4z8lgl\">You can check it out here (click here).</a></strong></p><p>Enjoy the choppy days, take a breath. Days like this I go and do a project around the homestead, or DVD hunting (I’m a physical media collector) or take my dog on a long walk. Staring at a tiny red daily candle will just drive you insane!</p><p><strong>One last note: </strong>Recall how I said for SpaceX, <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$SPCX&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span>  to “avoid”? That, if its a great company, we can circle back to it in 2-3 years? Just like we did with Palantir, <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$PLTR&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span> back in 2024… Instead of doing Midweek Movers next week, I am going through all of the IPOs from 2023 and 2024. No guarantees that I will find another Palantir again… but thats the goal. Stay tuned… </p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><p>Simple update today! If you have questions, feel free to swing by the chat. </p><h4>If you like this content please like ❤️ and re-stack! 🔄 </h4><div class=\"captioned-button-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/this-is-not-what-the-beginning-of?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Share&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CaptionedButtonToDOM\"><div class=\"preamble\"><p class=\"cta-caption\">Know someone panicking about the market? Send this to them so they can take a breath. </p></div><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/this-is-not-what-the-beginning-of?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Share&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/this-is-not-what-the-beginning-of?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share\"><span>Share</span></a></p></div>",
